cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these models, please cite them as below."
title: "Lungenkrebspatientenpfad – MiHUB (BPMN-Modell)"
abstract: >-
  BPMN 2.0 models of the overarching lung-cancer patient pathway and nine
  sub-pathways (initial entry, screening, diagnostics, patient consultation, tumor board,
  molecular tumor board, treatment, palliative care [draft], aftercare), developed in the MiHUB
  project (TU Dresden / Forschungsgruppe Digital Health). A research, education and
  interoperability-reference artifact — not clinically validated and not for use
  in direct patient care (see DISCLAIMER.md).
type: dataset
